<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
Author: Claude Opus 5.5 Medium
Date: 26-November-2026
PURPOSE: The app's entitlements, for 0.7.10's Game Center boards and achievements (plans/25-Nov-2026-shot-of-the-day-plan.md
         stage 3 item 1). One key: Game Center, which App/GameCenter/GameCenter.swift needs to sign the player in, post
         the daily score and the streak, and report achievements. The same file serves the iPhone, iPad and Mac builds
         of the one app target, through the target's CODE_SIGN_ENTITLEMENTS setting (Debug and Release).
         The Mac's app sandbox is not written here: it comes from the target's ENABLE_APP_SANDBOX build setting, and the
         outgoing connections Game Center needs in the sandbox from ENABLE_OUTGOING_NETWORK_CONNECTIONS, so this file
         holds no Mac-only key that an iPhone build would carry.
SRP/DRY check: Pass - the only entitlements file in the project; the sandbox stays in the build settings where it was.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>com.apple.developer.game-center</key>
	<true/>
</dict>
</plist>
